Growe welcomes those who are excited to:

• Work closely with business units and technical teams to clarify requests and track task progress;

•
Monitor Grafana boards to assess system performance and detect potential issues;

•
Record incidents in JSM/Jira in compliance with established workflows;

•
Handle support tickets, ensuring they are updated regularly and resolved promptly;

•
Escalate incidents when required, adhering to internal protocols;

•
Draft and deliver notifications about scheduled or unscheduled technical activities;

•
Collect detailed technical information using the available tools for further escalation of issues to the appropriate development team.&nbsp;

We need your professional experience:

• 6-12 months of experience in Technical Support or L1 Support;

•
English proficiency at B1+/B2 level or higher for written communication and working with technical documentation;

•
Understanding of client-server architecture, HTTP, REST API, request/response, and HTTP status codes;

•
Ability to use browser DevTools (Network, Console);

•
Experience with any ticketing system (Jira, Zendesk, Freshdesk, etc.);

•
Ability to independently reproduce issues and clearly document them for developers: steps to reproduce, expected and actual results, timestamps, IDs, screenshots/videos.&nbsp;&nbsp;

We appreciate if you have those personal features:

• Analytical thinking: looking beyond the reported symptoms to identify the root cause of an issue;

•
Attention to detail when working with statuses, IDs, logs, transactions, etc;

•
Ownership: taking responsibility for cases until resolution and following up on escalated issues;

•
Proactivity: checking documentation, previous cases, and available systems before escalation;

•
Ability to prioritize multiple cases simultaneously, considering SLAs and business impact;

•
Willingness to learn and quickly understand new products, systems, and processes.&nbsp;

We are seeking those who align with our core values:

•
GROWE TOGETHER: Our team is our main asset. We work together and support each other to achieve our common goals;

•
DRIVE RESULT OVER PROCESS: We set ambitious, clear, measurable goals in line with our strategy and driving Growe to success;

•
BE READY FOR CHANGE: We see challenges as opportunities to grow and evolve. We adapt today to win tomorrow.
